   "texto": [
    "Many professions form the feminine by adding **-in**: **der Lehrer** → **die Lehrerin** (teacher), **der Koch** → **die Köchin** (cook). There are changes in spelling and some professions have their own forms, so it is appropriate to learn each couple.",
    "To say the profession is usually not used: **Ich bin Lehrerin**. With an adjective it does appear: **Ich bin eine gute Lehrerin** (I am a good teacher)."
